[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Document" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/core/document.gd" id="1_doc"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_doc")
id = &"d18_photometer_log"
title = "C-6 — certification log"
byline = "quarterly, 1966–77, one hand throughout"
hand = 1
body = "PHOTOMETER C-6. CERT QUARTERLY.
LUMINAIRE C-1. 150W. DIMMER DRIVEN.

DATE      LAMP  DIST   READ   SPEC
Q1 1966    B    2.0M   121    120 +/- 8
Q2 1966    B    2.0M   119    120 +/- 8
Q3 1966    B    2.0M   120    120 +/- 8
Q4 1966    B    2.0M   118    120 +/- 8

Forty-four entries. The same distance, the
same lamp, the same two minutes of somebody's
quarter, for eleven years.

Q1 1977    B    2.0M   117    120 +/- 8
Q2 1977    B    2.0M   116    120 +/- 8
                LAMP LOW BUT IN SPEC.
                NEW TUBE ON ORDER.

TWO METRES IS THE STANDING DISTANCE.
IT IS MARKED ON THE FLOOR.

IF THE READING FALLS AND THE LAMP HAS NOT
CHANGED THEN SOMETHING IS IN THE WAY.
THAT IS ALL A READING CAN TELL YOU AND IT
IS ENOUGH.

                              E. OSTRANDER"
